## Research Notice

This project contains experimental components and proof-of-concept features.

Some functions may perform network analysis, metadata correlation, statistical
processing, or experimental estimation techniques.

Any information generated by the software, including IP-related information,
network observations, metadata analysis, or approximate geolocation results,
must be considered informational only.

Results may vary significantly depending on technical factors including, but
not limited to:

• VPN services.
• Proxy servers.
• Carrier-grade NAT.
• Mobile operators.
• Internet Service Providers (ISPs).
• Cloud infrastructure.
• Content Delivery Networks (CDNs).
• Firewalls.
• Routing changes.
• Third-party infrastructure.
• Network configuration.
• Changes in external services.

